			"notes": "### Initial NeoForge Server Port\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"947a90bac26e2a343349b8a094127844acc0edb6\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09546996-980a-49c4-a105-d27a9d04a8ae\" />\n\n\n- Added initial NeoForge 1.21.1 dedicated-server port of Terrain Diffusion.\n- Requires NeoForge 21.1.233+ and Java 21.\n- Supports server-side Terrain Diffusion world generation via server.properties.\n- Added Windows DirectML GPU inference support.\n- Bundles ONNX Runtime DirectML support inside the jar.\n- Added automatic model download and validation.\n- Added /td-explore terrain explorer web UI support.\n- Added per-world Terrain Diffusion scale persistence.\n- Known limitation: server-side only; no client world-creation UI yet."
